        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-K4018, Ravenna Front Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ravenna Knocker is a beautiful example of traditional decor. It will add a historical touch to your front door. It is available in a wide array of finishes. It is 6-7/8 inches tall and 3 inches wide. The Ravenna Door Knocker comes packaged with the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Ravenna Solid Brass Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
